			"notes": "### Additions\n - The Displacement Tome now accepts all items in the `things:displacement_tome_fuels` tag as fuel\n - Both variants of Gleaming Ore have been added to the `c:ores` block tag\n - All interactions with an Agglomeration now get passed through to the selected agglomerated item\n\n### Changes\n - The Displacement Tome's interface has been rewritten using owo-ui for improved UX and visuals\n - Fuel is no longer inserted into the Displacement Tome by sneak right-clicking, rather the item itself must be right-clicked onto fuel in the inventory\n\n### Fixes\n - A semi-rare crash when wearing a Mining Glove near a beacon has been fixed (#52)\n - The Infernal Scepter advancement is no longer awarded upon damaging *any* item (#56)"
